enum RunStatus {
  pending
  running
  waiting_approval
  /// The run posted an interactive card with `wait: true` and is suspended
  /// until a person presses one of its buttons. Non-terminal and holds the
  /// (agent, thread) run slot, exactly like `waiting_approval` — deliberately
  /// a distinct value because "waiting for approval" is the wrong words for a
  /// form, and that label is user-visible in four admin surfaces.
  waiting_input
  completed
  failed
  cancelled
}

// Where a run's agent-authored reply belongs. Judged before the run starts by
// the engagement orchestrator (model-made, never string-matched): `thread` when
// the answer belongs to the triggering exchange, `channel` when it is a
// standalone contribution to the room. Null ≡ the historical default (thread).
enum RunReplyPlacement {
  thread
