  /// gate: approval visibility otherwise reaches any member who can read a
  /// public channel, which would let a colleague authorise an email sent in
  /// somebody else's name. Falls back to `requiredApproverRole` when no such
  /// person resolves — an inbound-email run has no requesting user — so a
  /// request never becomes unanswerable.
  requiredApproverUserId String?        @map("required_approver_user_id") @db.Uuid
